WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.390
Scientists date the Big Bang to
about 13.8 billion years ago.

2
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.160
Long before modern
cosmology, Guru Nanak asked:

3
00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:13.400
what was the time, the
moment, the date, the season,

4
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.470
when creation came to be?

5
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.440
So does Sikh scripture
leave room for the Big Bang,

6
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.060
and for evolution?

7
00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:24.580
In this mission, you'll read how the Guru
Granth Sahib pictures the darkness before

8
00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:27.180
creation, and countless worlds.

9
00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:30.880
Then you'll weigh up how Sikhs
respond to secularisation,

10
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.200
as religion loses influence
in modern society.

11
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.770
Your mission: weigh up whether Sikh
teaching leaves room for the Big Bang.
